    "DevDoctor cannot apply the automatic fix right now: ": "DevDoctor 目前无法应用自动修复：",
    "DevDoctor looks at how your Mac is set up for development and explains, in plain words, what is broken, why it matters and how to fix it. It never changes anything without showing you first.": "DevDoctor 会检查您 Mac 的开发环境配置，并用通俗的语言说明哪里出了问题、为什么重要以及如何修复。它绝不会在未事先展示的情况下更改任何内容。",
    "DevDoctor observed this directly on your Mac.": "DevDoctor 在您的 Mac 上直接观察到了这一点。",
    "DevDoctor puts back the ": "DevDoctor 将恢复 ",
    "DevDoctor puts back the %@ file(s) it saved before this repair.": "DevDoctor 将恢复此修复前保存的 %@ 个文件。",
    "DevDoctor puts back the %@ file(s) it saved before “%@”. If a file changed since, the restore is refused to protect your edits.": "DevDoctor 将恢复在“%2$@”之前保存的 %1$@ 个文件。如果此后文件被修改过，将拒绝恢复以保护您的编辑。",
    "DevDoctor records the transaction before changing anything.": "DevDoctor 会在更改任何内容之前记录事务。",
    "DevDoctor sends a normal termination request to PID %@. Unsaved work in that process may be lost.": "DevDoctor 将向 PID %@ 发送正常终止请求。该进程中未保存的工作可能会丢失。",
    "DevDoctor starts your login shell three times and, for zsh, traces one start line by line. Nothing is changed.": "DevDoctor 会启动您的登录 shell 三次，对于 zsh 还会逐行跟踪一次启动。不会做任何更改。",
    "DevDoctor takes a ": "DevDoctor 会在每次检查后创建一份",
